,"user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"That's the intent; the engine is initialized in `initEngine` ahead of the `renderView` which is initialized in `onInitRenderView`, so while very unlikely, it's not impossible for the engine to be 'around' and for `renderView` to be `null`.. in which case, we do want to `forceQuit` the process as done here.","created_at":"2026-01-08T21:27:35Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T21:27:35Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114207#discussion_r2673965030","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114207","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2673965030"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114207#discussion_r2673965030"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114207"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2673965030/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":753,"original_start_line":753,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":757,"original_line":757,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2673425737,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":27,"position":27,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2673974869","pull_request_review_id":3641406116,"id":2673974869,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6fYZ5V","diff_hunk":"@@ -104,13 +105,37 @@ internal class VkThread(private val vkSurfaceView: VkSurfaceView, private val vk\n \t\t\t\ttry {\n \t\t\t\t\tLog.i(TAG, \"Waiting on exit for $name\")\n \t\t\t\t\tlockCondition.await()\n-\t\t\t\t} catch (ex: InterruptedException) {\n+\t\t\t\t} catch (_: InterruptedException) {\n \t\t\t\t\tcurrentThread().interrupt()\n \t\t\t\t}\n \t\t\t}\n \t\t}\n \t}\n \n+\t/**\n+\t * Request the thread to exit and block up to the given [timeInMs] until it's done.\n+\t *\n+\t * @return true if the thread exited, false otherwise.\n+\t */\n+\tfun requestExitAndWait(timeInMs: Long): Boolean {\n+\t\tlock.withLock {\n+\t\t\tshouldExit = true\n+\t\t\tlockCondition.signalAll()\n+\n+\t\t\tvar remainingTimeInNanos = TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS.toNanos(timeInMs)\n+\t\t\twhile (!exited && remainingTimeInNanos > 0) {\n+\t\t\t\ttry {\n+\t\t\t\t\tLog.i(TAG, \"Waiting on exit for $name for $remainingTimeInNanos\")","path":"platform/android/java/lib/src/main/java/org/godotengine/godot/vulkan/VkThread.kt","commit_id":"422cc7b91bfd10b293673f6497daa6daf469fabe","original_commit_id":"422cc7b91bfd10b293673f6497daa6daf469fabe","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"There is an `await` call right after which would cause the thread to wait until it's signaled again, so it should only spam if the thread keeps getting signaled right after it starts waiting. \r\nIn that scenario, I think we want to have the spam logs as an indication that something is going very wrong :)","created_at":"2026-01-08T21:31:22Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T21:31:23Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114207#discussion_r2673974869